       declaration law = official text "仅有在指引中声明所处理的用户信息，才可以调用平台提供
       的对应接口或组件。若未声明，对应接口或组件将直接禁用" (only user-info kinds declared in
       the MP-admin "User Privacy Protection Guideline" may call the matching API/component; undeclared
       = directly disabled) - a platform-side fail-closed hard gate in addition to msgSecCheck;
       full-enablement timeline = originally 2023-09-15, official 2023-09-14 update DELAYED to
       2023-10-17, after which privacy features enable regardless of the app.json __usePrivacyCheck__
       flag; base-library 2.32.3 is the version line (below = not integrated, no interception);
       three API faces = wx.getPrivacySetting (active query needAuthorization + privacyContractName),
       wx.onNeedPrivacyAuthorization (passive listen, eventInfo.referrer = triggering API),
       wx.requirePrivacyAuthorize (simulated trigger); consent component = <button
       open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization"> with bindagreeprivacyauthorization callback, couplable
       with getPhoneNumber / getRealtimePhoneNumber / getUserInfo in one tap (open-type union);
       official privacy popup fallback = when the developer does not respond to the listen event,
       WeChat itself pops the official dialog; after a user REFUSAL, calls within 10 seconds do not
       re-pop and fail directly (anti-nag throttle); two styles = coupled style (checkbox required,
       refusal error code 103) vs direct style (refusal error code 104);
       incremental re-sync law = after a guideline update, previously-declared APIs need no re-consent
       while NEWLY-added APIs/components do (official example: chooseLocation callable vs
       getWeRunData not); user deleting the mini-program from the recent list clears the sync state;
       error codes = errno 112 "api scope is not declared in the privacy agreement" (declaration
       supplement takes effect after 5 minutes) + "appid privacy api banned" (checking
       "no privacy collection" at review or never declaring = platform revokes the API permission);
       nickname-input special case = <input type="nickname"> degrades to type="text" on focus when
       consent is missing, no listen event fired.)
